157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (It is a matter of pleasures me to introduce you the Department of Education and Training at Gautam Buddha University. The department carries prominence for its strong foundation in education with emphasis on evidence-based practices and multidisciplinary approach to psychological wellbeing & mental health in educational settings. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (The department is nationally and internationally recognizable for providing the services and training in the area of applied Psychology and mental health. Besides the above, a large number of national and international conferences, seminars and workshops are organized by the department which provide a variety of exposures to the students and inculcate leadership skills and team spirit among them. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (The department has a team of loyal & dedicated faculty members & staffs who have performed admirably and given their undivided support and relentless dedication in accomplishing and executing the vision and mission of the University. All the faculty members have wide and extensive experience of teaching and research which pave a strong path for enhancement learning and overall development for the students. The teaching & training pedagogy at the department is student-centric which promote application-based learning, critical thinking, research skills, and ethical practices in the field of education. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
