163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (It gives me immense pleasure to welcome you all to the Department of Education and Training under the aegis of School of Humanities & Social Sciences, at Gautam Buddha University, Greater Noida. The inception of department place in the academic year, 2012 with a vision to be the premier research and training center in the field of education and training and to earn the national and international recognition in this field. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
